{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "idea",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 150,
			"text": "## 1. Idea or feedback\nSomething to change: wording, a question, an image, a colour.",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "note",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 380,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 190,
			"text": "## 2. Write it down\nAdd it to [[Change requests]].\nPage · what it says now · what it should say.\n\n(Claude in **Cowork** can tidy this up for you.)",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "claude",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 760,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 170,
			"text": "## 3. Ask Claude\nClaude Desktop → **Code** → **Cloud** → `stellar-origins`\nPaste the *Make a change* prompt from [[Prompts]].",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "pr",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 760,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 170,
			"text": "## 4. Claude opens a pull request\nYou get a short summary, the PR link and a **preview link**.\nNothing is live yet.",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "check",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 380,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 130,
			"text": "## 5. Check the preview\nOpen the preview link on your phone and computer.",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "fix",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 130,
			"text": "### Not right?\nTell Claude what to adjust in the same session. It updates the preview.",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "ship",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 380,
			"y": 480,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "## 6. Say \"ship it\"\nClaude merges the pull request as you.",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "live",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 760,
			"y": 480,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "## 7. Live in ~1 minute\nhttps://stellar-origins.vercel.app updates automatically.",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "log",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1140,
			"y": 480,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "## 8. Log it\nMove the item to *Done* and add a row to [[Change log]].",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "undo",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1140,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 150,
			"text": "### Something broke after going live?\nUse the *Undo the last change* prompt. Claude reverts it the same way.",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "data",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1140,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 170,
			"text": "## Anytime: collect data\nSupabase → SQL Editor → paste a query → Run → Export CSV.\nSee [[Collecting data]].",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "site",
			"type": "link",
			"url": "https://stellar-origins.vercel.app",
			"x": 0,
